# Baseline stand (Yury, 18.09.2026)

The human has a BASELINE state: standing upright with no input. In that state the body
must be still. Standing shaking, twitching arms or drifting is a DEFECT, not a style.

## The check (run it after ANY change to arms, pose servos, balance, materials or colliders)
1. Build from bash only (a bash launcher, never PowerShell). If Yury's editor is open, the
   gate reports SKIPPED: do not burn turns, report the skip.
2. Run the stance trial (label `stance_reg*`, 40 s, no input).
3. Read the per-frame CSV, window 1.0-39.0 s, and report these numbers EVERY time:
   - RMS joint speed of shoulder and elbow (deg/s);
   - direction reversals per second of shoulderAngleL/R and elbowAngleL/R;
   - joint-limit hit fraction (elbowLimitFraction, shoulderLimitFraction);
   - pelvisDrop (m) and the fraction of frames with both feet grounded.
## Known numbers (18.09.2026, build with the p_arms work, label stance_reg1b)
GREEN: pelvisDrop 0.0194 m (19 mm) - the body holds its height.
RED: rmsShoulderJointSpeed 181.72 deg/s, rmsElbowJointSpeed 311.56 deg/s; identical in
stance_reg1 (18:17), burn_stance (18:49) and m_stand1 (14:30). An idle stand should be
near zero, so the arm servos are oscillating and the elbow reaches its limit for ~26% of
frames in the p_arms runs (elbowLimitFraction 0.2593 on p_arms39).
## Acceptance
- pelvisDrop <= 0.025 m over 40 s;
- both feet grounded in >= 99% of quiet frames (wSupQuietFrames 200/200);
- zero joint-limit hits in the arms during the quiet window;
- RMS joint speed of shoulder and elbow BELOW the threshold pinned by the first clean
  build (calibration run), and reversals per second consistent with a still body, not
  with a limit cycle;
- no reference signal that flips sign every frame: `Mathf.Sign(...)` inside a per-frame
  target is forbidden unless latched at a step boundary (see PoseDriveController armPhase).

## REGRESSION RECORD: the stand tremble, 18.09.2026 (measured, isolated)
Quiet: p_swQ 10:49 rmsShoulder 6.4, rmsElbow 18.9, hip speed median 0.0.
Trembling: p_swQ2 10:59 rmsShoulder 181.7, rmsElbow 311.6, hip speed median 88.0.
The pair differs in TWO things: build 49e76bfb -> 4de6dec8 and armSwingFraction 0.0265 -> 0.9963.
ISOLATION RUN (current build, 21:17): stance_now  vs  stance_noarm (-armSwing 0 -armElbowSwing 0)
